stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    %% A batch task controller with optional preparation and inter-step intervals.
    %% Seven states, sixteen independent transitions, and three pause/resume pairs.

    Idle: Idle
    Idle: awaiting a new batch
    Preparing: Preparing
    Preparing: initialize the batch
    Running: Running
    Running: process work steps
    Waiting: Waiting
    Waiting: between work steps

    state "Paused" as PreparingPaused
    PreparingPaused: from Preparing
    state "Paused" as RunningPaused
    RunningPaused: from Running
    state "Paused" as WaitingPaused
    WaitingPaused: from Waiting

    Idle --> Preparing: Start requested && preparation is enabled
    Idle --> Running: Start requested && preparation is disabled
    Preparing --> Running: Preparation complete
    Running --> Waiting: Step complete && interval is enabled
    Waiting --> Running: Interval complete && (repeat forever || steps remain)
    Running --> Idle: Batch complete && interval is disabled
    Waiting --> Idle: Interval complete && batch complete

    Preparing --> Idle: Stop requested && stop mode is Reset
    Running --> Idle: Stop requested && stop mode is Reset
    Waiting --> Idle: Stop requested && stop mode is Reset

    Preparing --> PreparingPaused: Stop requested && stop mode is Pause
    Running --> RunningPaused: Stop requested && stop mode is Pause
    Waiting --> WaitingPaused: Stop requested && stop mode is Pause
    PreparingPaused --> Preparing: Resume requested
    RunningPaused --> Running: Resume requested
    WaitingPaused --> Waiting: Resume requested
